# linear-issue/claude/extreme 240x60 @150,0 (90x56)
│                                                                                       ✕
│  Linear draft
│
│  E  同期ワーカーが 429 の後に Retry-After を無視する: honor the header in every retry
│     path, including the nightly reconciliation job and the manual resync command
│
│  T  Team      Platform (PLT)
│  S  Status    Todo
│  P  Priority  Medium
│  L  Labels    Bug, Area/reliability, Docs
│  J  Project   None
│
│  The sync worker doubles its delay after every 429 and never reads Retry-After, so it
│  retries sooner than the shop API allows and gets limited again. 再試行が早すぎるため、
│  制限が解除されません。
│
│  • Read Retry-After (seconds or an HTTP date) from the 429 response
│  • Wait at least that long, then go back to the doubling delay
│    • 上限は MAX_DELAY のまま
│  [x] Reproduce it against the stub
│  [ ] Cap the wait at MAX_DELAY
│  [ ] Cover the nightly reconciliation job
│
│  Answer                    Today                    After
│  429 with Retry-After: 30  waits 2 seconds, then 4  waits 30 seconds
│  429 alone                 doubles                  doubles
│
│    curl -sI https://shop.example/api/orders?page=1&per_page=250&status=any | grep -i re…
│
│  Where: src/sync.sh, src/config.sh, src/jobs/reconcile.sh
│
│  Done when: a 429 with Retry-After: 30 makes the worker wait 30 seconds before its next
│  try.
│
│  Source: acme/sync-worker · fix/retry-after
│
│  PLT-212 may already cover this  Sync worker retries too fast after rate limiting
│  Create… ↵  Discard [d]  □ Then open in Linear [o]
